7592186355964 1089 "q-164516" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355964 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535580 true] [17592186355964 1100 "Identify the following surface: \n\n$$\n{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}=1,\\,-\\infty <x<\\infty .\n$$" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355964 1113 #uuid "053926ce-0dff-5aef-bfd1-e83aa21062c5" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355964 1145 "Recall that the equation of an elliptic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $z$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nThus, an elliptic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $x$**-axis** is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{c}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our equation is an elliptic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis and $b=c=1.$" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355965 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355966 13194139535580 true] [17592186355965 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355967 13194139535580 true] [17592186355965 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355968 13194139535580 true] [17592186355965 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355969 13194139535580 true] [17592186355965 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355970 13194139535580 true] [17592186355965 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535580 true] [17592186355965 1041 "selection" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355965 1104 #edb/ref 17592186355966 13194139535580 true] [17592186355965 1110 #uuid "f790f26b-c41f-5849-89e2-f6fad94e05bb" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355966 1034 "An elliptic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355966 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535580 true] [17592186355966 1111 #uuid "55f3c4e2-5bd5-5912-8dc7-0e7f21c45759" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355967 1034 "A hyperbolic paraboloid whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355967 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535580 true] [17592186355967 1111 #uuid "4733e6f0-f206-5b9f-abf1-424b35adfa19" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355968 1034 "An elliptic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355968 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535580 true] [17592186355968 1111 #uuid "f25fbd18-bad6-56e4-8efc-44801d44e3a1" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355969 1034 "A hyperbolic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355969 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535580 true] [17592186355969 1111 #uuid "ad1f24e8-1a9c-5b03-8b3c-40ad0cd72dad" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355970 1034 "A hyperbolic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355970 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535580 true] [17592186355970 1111 #uuid "3e486243-b8a7-59e3-ad81-7d33c0ff56cf" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355971 1017 #edb/ref 17592186355972 13194139535580 true] [17592186355971 1089 "q-164549" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355971 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535580 true] [17592186355971 1100 "Identify the surface ${y}^{2}-{z}^{2}-x-4y-6z-4=0.$" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355971 1113 #uuid "7a50f136-2ecf-5b35-8044-78d3351fdd71" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355971 1145 "First, we complete the square in the $y$ and $z$ terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{2}-{z}^{2}-x-4y-6z-4 & =0 \\\\ ({y}^{2}-4y)-({z}^{2}+6z)-x-4 & =0 \\\\ (y-2)^{2}-4-(z+3)^{2}+9-x-4 & =0 \\\\ (y-2)^{2}-(z+3)^{2}+1-x & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, by rearranging, we get the equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(y-2)^{2}-(z+3)^{2}+1-x & =0 \\\\ (y-2)^{2}-(z+3)^{2} & =x-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is the equation of a hyperbolic paraboloid centered at $(1,2,-3).$" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355972 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355973 13194139535580 true] [17592186355972 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355974 13194139535580 true] [17592186355972 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355975 13194139535580 true] [17592186355972 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355976 13194139535580 true] [17592186355972 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355977 13194139535580 true] [17592186355972 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535580 true] [17592186355972 1041 "selection" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355972 1104 #edb/ref 17592186355975 13194139535580 true] [17592186355972 1110 #uuid "b86800b4-0f8d-57c6-85ea-6de4b890552e" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355973 1034 "An elliptic paraboloid centered at $(1,2,-3)$" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355973 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535580 true] [17592186355973 1111 #uuid "92056e5e-93d9-5ec2-8399-dc50b6aca04d" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355974 1034 "A hyperbolic paraboloid centered at $(1,-2,3)$" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355974 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535580 true] [17592186355974 1111 #uuid "3530f0ca-c0c7-5afb-9296-99d0c1b9963b" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355975 1034 "A hyperbolic paraboloid centered at $(1,2,-3)$" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355975 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535580 true] [17592186355975 1111 #uuid "b8bc513c-12c9-5390-b82c-323c92576473" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355976 1034 "A hyperbolic paraboloid centered at $(-1,2,3)$" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355976 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535580 true] [17592186355976 1111 #uuid "3fff997a-b47e-58b2-88db-deb8ab0fbcf1" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355977 1034 "An ellipsoid centered at $(1,2,-3)$" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355977 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535580 true] [17592186355977 1111 #uuid "0ae5056a-b92f-5440-b7cc-8088e9b11057" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355978 1017 #edb/ref 17592186355979 13194139535580 true] [17592186355978 1089 "q-36110" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355978 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535580 true] [17592186355978 1100 "Identify the surface $4{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-25{z}^{2}+16x+50z+91=0.$" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355978 1113 #uuid "616a7efa-b0f3-555d-b2fa-29047d5c993a" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355978 1145 "First, we complete the square in the $x$ and $z$ terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-25{z}^{2}+16x+50z+91 & =0 \\\\ 4({x}^{2}+4x)+{y}^{2}-25({z}^{2}-2z)+91 & =0 \\\\ 4[(x+2)^{2}-4]+{y}^{2}-25[(z-1)^{2}-1]+91 & =0 \\\\ 4(x+2)^{2}-16+{y}^{2}-25(z-1)^{2}+25+91 & =0 \\\\ 4(x+2)^{2}+{y}^{2}-25(z-1)^{2}+100 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, by rearranging, we get the equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4(x+2)^{2}+{y}^{2}-25(z-1)^{2}+100 & =0 \\\\ 4(x+2)^{2}+{y}^{2}-25(z-1)^{2} & =-100 \\\\ \\frac{(x+2)^{2}}{25}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{100}-\\frac{(z-1)^{2}}{4} & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is the equation of a hyperboloid of two sheets centered at $(-2,0,1).$" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355979 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355980 13194139535580 true] [17592186355979 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355981 13194139535580 true] [17592186355979 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355982 13194139535580 true] [17592186355979 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355983 13194139535580 true] [17592186355979 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355984 13194139535580 true] [17592186355979 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535580 true] [17592186355979 1041 "selection" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355979 1104 #edb/ref 17592186355981 13194139535580 true] [17592186355979 1110 #uuid "63b4fb69-3146-591b-b6f7-8be87e1fcdd9" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355980 1034 "A hyperboloid of one sheet centered at $(2,0,-1)$" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355980 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535580 true] [17592186355980 1111 #uuid "3ac8f862-048b-54bc-a025-73af865271b0" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355981 1034 "A hyperboloid of two sheets centered at $(-2,0,1)$" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355981 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535580 true] [17592186355981 1111 #uuid "db46510d-d885-52a6-a1aa-d0bba625ab51" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355982 1034 "An elliptic cone centered at $(-2,0,1)$" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355982 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535580 true] [17592186355982 1111 #uuid "2e9481b0-8c36-5709-b51c-b938a49f719c" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355983 1034 "A hyperboloid of one sheet centered at $(-2,0,1)$" 13194139535580 true] [17592186355983 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535580 true] [17592186355983 1111 #uuid "8d14e072-e680-5b03-8a